      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Radeon Driver be known to be unstable often.\n\nSo using latest driver on those be not always welcome.\n\nIf you find stable driver version, you better use that version.\n\n(as this is basically AMD issue than VRChat issue)\n\nAccording to Virtual Desktop author who actively monitoring stabillity of Radeon driver stated, current recommended driver version as follow.\n\n=Recommended GPU drivers=\n\nNvidia: any drivers\n\nAMD RX 400/500: 20.10.1 \n\nhttps://www.amd.com/en/support/kb/release-notes/rn-rad-win-20-10-1\n\nAMD 5000/6000: 22.11.2 \n\nhttps://www.amd.com/en/support/kb/release-notes/rn-rad-win-22-11-2\n\nAMD 7000: 23.10.2 \n\nhttps://www.amd.com/en/support/kb/release-notes/rn-rad-win-23-10-2",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
